  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for SendGrid — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for ISendGridClient.SendEmailAsync. Includes a built-in SendGridTransientErrors predicate covering rate limiting (429), server errors (500), and service unavailability (503). Essential for any app that must reliably deliver transactional or marketing email.",
