  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Fix package icon (was showing an incorrect/placeholder image). 1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientSendGridClient wraps ISendGridClient in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline. Automatically throws SendGridTransientException for 429, 500, and 503 responses so Polly can retry them. Supports net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
